   "id": 532173,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Loss of wetlands has a great impact both on the biotic and abiotic parts of an ecosystem. Wetlands provide rich habitats and act as a filter for pollution. Some loss of wetland is due to silt and invasive species clogging water flow.To restore these wetlands, it is often enough to _____.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1041456,
     "content_html": "open new waterways"
    },
    {
     "id": 1041457,
     "content_html": "restore the water supply"
    },
    {
     "id": 1041458,
     "content_html": "re-introduce endangered animals"
    },
    {
     "id": 1041459,
     "content_html": "introduce water adapted plants"
    }
   ],
